{"id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","title":"Closed Set","display":"df-closed-set — Closed Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-closed-set","aliases":["58-df-closed-set","Closed Set","58-df-zfc-top6-closed-set"],"display":"df-closed-set — Closed Set","depends_on":["[[./58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-diff.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-closed-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-closed-set</span><span>Closed Set</span><span>58-df-zfc-top6-closed-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-set — Closed Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"./58-df-topology.md\">58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"921053d07d9c7906\" href=\"?note=921053d07d9c7906\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-diff.md\">../batch01/58-df-diff.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,F\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,F\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq X\">\\(F\\subseteq X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"./58-df-topology.md\">58-df-topology.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closed}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Closed}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Closed}_S(F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land F\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus F\\in\\tau\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Closed}_S(F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land F\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias\\text{-}top6} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Closed}_S(F,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias\\text{-}top6} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Closed}_S(F,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closed means that the complement is open.</li>\n<li>No unary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closed}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Closed}_X\\)</span> predicate is introduced: without carrying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> as arguments it would leave the ambient topology free.</li>\n<li>Sequential closedness is equivalent to closedness only under additional hypotheses (for example, in first-countable spaces), so it is not asserted here.</li>\n<li>Closed sets satisfy: arbitrary intersection, finite union are closed</li>\n<li>Closure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{F}\">\\(\\bar{F}\\)</span>: smallest closed superset; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{F} = F \\cup \\partial F\">\\(\\bar{F} = F \\cup \\partial F\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>: closed bounded; compact by Heine-Borel in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-diff.md","status":"resolved","id":"921053d07d9c7906","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-diff.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[./58-df-topology.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closed}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Closed}_S(F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land F\\subseteq X\\land X\\setminus F\\in\\tau","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias\\text{-}top6} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Closed}_S(F,X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closed}_X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{F} = F \\cup \\partial F","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[{"id":"42d80f2fd93c2116","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]])"},{"id":"bf393c071d76e455","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Closed}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]])"},{"id":"bf97099d9a48be46","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bf469772e5a6dfb0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Closed}_S$ (closed-set predicate, see [[58-df-closed-set]])"},{"id":"6d4e0dd8108a0768","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S$ (closed-set predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]])"},{"id":"1f140d586b55a13f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_-$（$H^-$ 的范数拓扑）与 $\\operatorname{Closed}_S(\\operatorname{ran}P,H^-,\\tau_-)$（见 [[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md|58-df-closed-set]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["e7514bc4cefba4f2","921053d07d9c7906"]}